---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing — LinksMaxing"
  description="Pricing is a conversation, not a chart. Every engagement is scoped to what your business actually needs."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">Pricing</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Pricing is a <em>conversation.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Every engagement is scoped to what your business actually needs. A published rate card would either overcharge the small work or undersell the real work. So we don't publish one.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="sec-num">01 / how we think about it</div>
    <h2 class="sec-head">Three ways clients <em>work with us.</em></h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Engagement 01</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">Visibility check</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">A one-time scan and correlation report. Fixed scope, fixed price. Runs about a week. Priced for any business willing to know the truth about where they stand.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Engagement 02</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">Project</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">A rebuild, a schema overhaul, a set of answer pages, a GBP cleanup. Scoped from the visibility check findings. Fixed timeline, fixed price, one deliverable.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Engagement 03</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">Retainer</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">Ongoing monitoring, monthly scans, cadence work on the surfaces we've built together. Monthly fee, month-to-month, cancel anytime.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <h2 class="cta-head">Tell us what you're <em>trying to do.</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">We'll scope it honestly. If the work isn't a fit for us, we'll say so — and often point you to someone who does fit.</p>
    <a href="mailto:harper@linksmaxing.com?subject=Pricing" class="btn">Book a call →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
